                'Gribble Junk-Magus', 'Orc Stone-Rend', 'Vorga Ash-Shaman', 'Krak One-Horn',
                'Skrit Gear', 'Brog Skull', 'Droknar Night-Blade', 'Gorvash the Stone-Ram',
